      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 848,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Schedule and tenant intake\n\nStarts the daily churn scan, loads configuration values, reads tenant master data, and initializes looping through tenants one at a time."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
